WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.020
[Percussion music]

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.420
Air team, Call in!

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.460
Shamrock, Go!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.180
Borkins, Go!

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.580
Cadet Puncheater!

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.520
I'm here! I'm sorry, I'm just a bit nervous...

00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:23.025
We'll be home before lunch, Rookie.

00:00:23.025 --> 00:00:25.735
Yeah... A packed bologna sandwich, a Twix bar...

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.420
and a Coke just in case.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.040
You can eat sandwiches on the plane?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:33.440
cut the chatter! The target is [...]

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.100
Coordinates locked,  Fire away!

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.660
Fox 3's, away!

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.200
[screaming]

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.260
Cadet, get a hold of yourself!

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.480
[C

00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.640
[Continues screaming]

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.020
Puncheater, eject!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.160
God dammit, Puncheater!

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.920
Hey... Did the new guy just die?!

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:09.780
Yes, he did...

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.880
Approaching target! Break into aggressive motion!

00:01:42.655 --> 00:01:44.765
We're in too close, pull out!

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:47.520
I have you now...

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.660
[Beeping Alarms and Explosions]

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.560
Son of a bitch!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.120
Hartsling! Come in Major Hartsling!

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:04.760
Hartsling here!

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.960
Lance, thank god! You need to come back to HQ

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.100
I'm not done here!

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:12.260
It's over... Operation A is a failure.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.620
Come back, Lance.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.180
[growls in frustration]

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:17.860
Shamrock, do you copy?

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:18.840
Yes sir.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.960
We're done here. Operation A is a failure.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.780
[Whirring energy]

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.820
What the hell is that?!

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.660
Oh no...

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:29.740
[Blasts and explosions]

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.380
Shane!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:41.200
[Blaring alarms]

